## Revised Recommended Execution Order

Given the current state, the report's execution order is **obsolete**. The new priority should be:

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["1. Create server/lib/util.ts<br/>(dedup nowSec in 50+ files, clampInt in 20, toFiniteNumber in 14)"]
    A --> B["2. Decompose traderCore.ts (74KB)<br/>traderTalent.ts (72KB) — still monolithic"]
    A --> C["3. Decompose grift.ts (58KB)<br/>griftEngine.ts (66KB) — still monolithic"]
    A --> D["4. Decompose storage.ts (57KB)<br/>wsCore.ts (57KB) — missed by report"]
    B --> E["5. Decompose admin.ts (70KB)<br/>partnerPortal.ts (62KB) — missed by report"]
    C --> F["6. Re-decompose AdminUserManagementTab (102KB)<br/>SystemConfigTab (95KB) — new god-files"]
    D --> G["7. Re-decompose ScoutChallengesPanel (105KB)<br/>PartnerPortalTabs (92KB) — new god-files"]
    E --> H["8. Decompose challengeEvaluationSupport (59KB)<br/>adminScout sub-files (40-56KB)"]
    F --> I["9. Remaining client monoliths<br/>(TradeScreen 88KB, ProfileSettings 81KB, etc.)"]
    G --> I
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Steps 1-5 are the actual critical path. Steps 6-9 address the **second-generation god-files** created by the decompositions that already happened.
